\f5\b0  SAM Coup\'e9 music for the Philips SAA1099 (the modland "Sam Coupe COP" corpus). The song's own Z80 replay routine \'97 or the shared E-Tracker player by Ethanol Software Inc (Maciej J. Woloszyk, Andrzej Siuda) \'97 runs on GME's Z80 core (Shay Green, LGPL-2.1), driving the SAA1099 emulated by SAASound by Dave Hooper and Simon Owen (BSD-3). Format handling follows Christopher O'Neill's SCPlayer (MIT).\
\ls2\ilvl0
