PlayerPRO (Macintosh, .mad):
\f5\b0  Antoine Rosset's classic Mac tracker (MADG/MADF/MADK formats), released by the author to the Public Domain. Played by a minimal slice of PlayerPRO's own "MADDriver" software synth (from the MaddTheSane/PlayerPRO mirror), driven offline in NoHardwareDriver mode. See playerpro/PROVENANCE.md.\
