FamiTracker (NES / Famicom, .ftm):
\f5\b0  jsr's (Jonathan Liss) NES/Famicom 2A03 tracker with VRC6/VRC7/MMC5/FDS expansions. Played in-process by a boost-free engine slice of the cross-platform FamiTracker CX fork by Dan Spencer (nukep), vendored at repo-root famitracker-cx/. Mixed GPL-2.0-or-later / New BSD; see famitracker-cx/PROVENANCE.md. Content-gated against the Atari "Face The Music" .ftm (handled by OpenMPT).\
