Ixalance (.ixs):
\f5\b0  Synth tracker by the defunct Shortcut Software Development BV (~2000); music by Maarten van Strien. Played via "webixs", Juergen Wothke's native C++ reimplementation reverse-engineered (Ghidra) from the lost Win32 player (bitbucket.org/wothke/webixs), vendored at repo-root webixs/. Licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (NonCommercial) \'97 the only NonCommercial component; see webixs/LICENSE.\
