vgmstream (streamed game audio, .adx / .hca / .fsb / ...):
\f5\b0  Adam Gashlin, bnnm, Christopher Snowhill and the vgmstream contributors' library for hundreds of console/PC streamed game-audio containers (CRI ADX & HCA, FMOD FSB, Microsoft XWB/XMA, platform DSP/VAG/AT3/AT9 and more). Vendored at external/vgmstream/ and driven through its libvgmstream API; built without vgmstream's optional external codec libraries. Content/extension-gated against formats already owned by other plugins. Licensed under the ISC License.\
\ls2\ilvl0
