Klystrack (chip tracker, .kt):
\f5\b0  Chiptunes authored in Tero Lindeman's klystrack tracker, rendered by the tracker's own klystron "cyd" software synth through its bundled libksnd library (both MIT). The plugin drives libksnd synchronously and builds it free of any real SDL dependency via a small local shim.\
\ls2\ilvl0
