FFmpeg (streaming & compressed audio):
\f5\b0  MP3, AAC, M4A/MP4, Ogg/Vorbis, Opus, FLAC, WAV, AIFF, AC3, MP2, WMA and IFF-8SVX are decoded in-process by FFmpeg's libavcodec/libavformat/libavutil/libswresample (ffmpeg.org). To keep the app free of GPL, a decode-only, LGPL build (FFmpeg 8.1.1, --disable-gpl --disable-nonfree, no libx264/libx265, no ffmpeg command-line tool) is vendored at external/ffmpeg-lgpl/ and dynamically linked as replaceable dylibs (satisfying the LGPL relink requirement). Licensed under LGPL-2.1-or-later. HTTPS for radio / resolved stream URLs uses OpenSSL (The OpenSSL Project, Apache-2.0).\
\ls2\ilvl0
